OL,3,GNEWSASchools in lockdown and boy in
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tuffley school and nearby Willow
OL,7,FPrimary Academy are locked down and
OL,8,Fofficers asked parents not to attend. A
OL,9,Fpolice spokesperson said there was "no
OL,10,Fongoing threat at the school" and
OL,11,Fpupils were safe within the school
OL,12,Fgrounds.
